  "cards": [
    {
      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "增量与性能",
      "items": [
        "增量分析：blake3 内容指纹 (fingerprint.rs) 跳过未变更文件",
        "并行解析：rayon 并行加载；cached GraphStore 增量重解析",
        "i18n：rust-i18n 内置 zh-CN / en 双语"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "violet",
      "title": "接口与特性门控",
      "items": [
        "features：cli / tui / serve / mcp / jsp / search-sql-v2；full 全开",
        "REST /api/v1 + 内嵌 Cytoscape.js 浏览器 UI（dagre 布局，callers/callees 面板）",
        "MCP 6 工具：stats / nodes / node_detail / trace / search_sql / query",
        "CGEF：Code Graph Exchange Format（schema.json + 校验器），跨团队合并",
        "iBatis/MyBatis 加载（ogsql-parser ibatis 特性解析 Mapper XML）产出的 SQL 节点并入图谱",
        "Java 方法提取（tree-sitter-java）与 iBatis/MyBatis 加载由扫描加载管线调度；图中以加载管线→SQL 提取为主路径，其余提取器关系见卡片",
        "导出器（DOT/JSON/Mermaid/NDJSON）由 CLI export 子命令驱动，从 GraphStore 读图导出"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "rose",
      "title": "图谱模型",
      "items": [
        "节点键 (key.rs)：namespace/class/method/SQL 标识，petgraph 有向图 + serde",
        "双向查询：callers() / callees() / trace() / impact()",
        "血缘 (lineage.rs)：语句级归因 + flow/ref 角色展示（v0.9 新增）",
        "SQL 搜索：search-sql-v2 特性（sql_match.rs）"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "amber",
      "title": "外部依赖",
      "items": [
        "ogsql-parser：git rev 锁定 (d88306a)，features = [\"ibatis\", \"java\"]",
        "tree-sitter 0.24 + tree-sitter-java 0.23（JSP 走预处理器）",
        "petgraph 0.7 (serde) · blake3 · bincode · rayon · walkdir · encoding_rs",
        "上游集成的注意点：codeweb×astgrep sql-pattern-search 受 tree-sitter 0.24/0.25 冲突阻断",
        "Java 方法提取基于 tree-sitter-java 0.23 语法树（图中以卡片说明，JSP 走预处理器）"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "slate",
      "title": "消费方与计划",
      "items": [
        "被 CodeRoughcollie 子进程调用（--codeweb-analyze，阶段三影响分析）",
        "升级链路：ogsql-parser AST 变更 → extractor.java (3108 行) / builder.rs (3966 行) 联动",
        "计划：Kotlin/Go 语言支持、语义影响分析增强"
      ]
    }
  ]
